{"id":"n26497-1-21","stage":1,"title":"바다 · 海","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26497-1-21-1","ko":"너 수영할 줄 아니?","zh":"你会游泳吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"수영할","meaning":"游泳","explanation":"수영하다：游泳；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"수영하다","audio":"/audio/0aa3907321a68bda6d12.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64613","senseId":"1","lemma":"수영하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수영할","audio":"/audio/3784c1a9829c71746939.mp3"}},{"text":"줄","meaning":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","explanation":"줄：表示某个方法或实际内容等。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}},{"text":"아니?","meaning":"会，能","explanation":"알다：会，能；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"5","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"0aa3907321a68bda","term":"수영하다","zh":"游泳","audio":"/audio/0aa3907321a68bda6d12.mp3","entryId":"64613","definition":"在水中游。","pronunciation":["수영하다"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"会，能","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"具有能做某事的能力或技术。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/95047bbc1e6b2eddf278.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26497-1-21-2","ko":"그럼. 섬이 고향이라 늘 바다에서 수영하며 자랐는걸.","zh":"会啊。我的家乡在岛上，所以从小就在海里游泳长大的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼.","meaning":"可不是，就是，当然","explanation":"그럼：可不是，就是，当然","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"섬이","meaning":"岛，岛屿","explanation":"섬：岛，岛屿；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"섬","audio":"/audio/ff1e417f3b3471b2fce7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65099","senseId":"1","lemma":"섬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"섬이","audio":"/audio/b1f41953e617c585a3b1.mp3"}},{"text":"고향이라","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고향이라","audio":"/audio/2a220833e37638e25567.mp3"}},{"text":"늘","meaning":"总，老，老是，经常","explanation":"늘：总，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"늘","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40481","senseId":"1","lemma":"늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늘","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3"}},{"text":"바다에서","meaning":"海，大海，海洋","explanation":"바다：海，大海，海洋；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"바다","audio":"/audio/1ea5c356f65344cfeb55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26497","senseId":"1","lemma":"바다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바다에서","audio":"/audio/5925fd490266913fd59a.mp3"}},{"text":"수영하며","meaning":"游泳","explanation":"수영하다：游泳；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"수영하다","audio":"/audio/0aa3907321a68bda6d12.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64613","senseId":"1","lemma":"수영하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수영하며","audio":"/audio/77b9aa062ef6b71037e9.mp3"}},{"text":"자랐는걸.","meaning":"生长，成长","explanation":"자라다：生长，成长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는걸：表示新发现、感叹或与对方预期不同的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"자라다","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66317","senseId":"2","lemma":"자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자랐는걸","audio":"/audio/d77505648f5225d0b7c3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"可不是，就是，当然","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"62277","definition":"用于肯定回答，表示自不必说，没有疑问。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"ff1e417f3b3471b2","term":"섬","zh":"岛，岛屿","audio":"/audio/ff1e417f3b3471b2fce7.mp3","entryId":"65099","definition":"周围被水包围、看上去好像浮在水面上的陆地。","pronunciation":["섬ː"]},{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"96a6023ce9edabaa","term":"늘","zh":"总，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3","entryId":"40481","definition":"无论什么时候都没变化，总是。","pronunciation":["늘"]},{"id":"1ea5c356f65344cf","term":"바다","zh":"海，大海，海洋","audio":"/audio/1ea5c356f65344cfeb55.mp3","entryId":"26497","definition":"在地球上除陆地以外被咸水填满的部分。","pronunciation":["바다"]},{"id":"0aa3907321a68bda","term":"수영하다","zh":"游泳","audio":"/audio/0aa3907321a68bda6d12.mp3","entryId":"64613","definition":"在水中游。","pronunciation":["수영하다"]},{"id":"17c36cbe99642c8e","term":"자라다","zh":"生长，成长","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3","entryId":"66317","definition":"在某种环境过背景下长大。","pronunciation":["자라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ec6a603a64c12a148b59.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26497","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/b